{
 "_source": "the mixer's shipped defaults, moved out of scripts/mix_schema.py (which keeps the ranges, the enums and the validation). `with_defaults()` lays a project's mix preset over this file; a preset writes only what it changes, and what it leaves alone is the default stated here. Loudness profiles are references/data/master_targets.json.",
 "_provenance": {
  "gain_staging": "starting values: the numbers the engine shipped with (legacy strategy); measure with scripts/mix_bench.py",
  "lead_carve": "starting values: the carve the mixer applied before it was data",
  "dynamics": "starting values: compressor and bus settings the engine shipped with",
  "spectral": "starting values: the per-role spectral profiles; a project replaces a profile by name",
  "space": "starting values: the room send per role and the synthesised tail; references/spatial/acoustic-laws.md for the physics",
  "sidechain": "starting values: the ducking the mixer applied before it was data",
  "automation": "starting values",
  "balance": "starting values: dB margins of the balance rows",
  "diagnostics": "starting values: thresholds of mix_diagnostics.py, advisory",
  "mastering": "starting values, except: highpass_hz 24 and order 1 are the long-standing master high-pass (a higher one removes the sub, knowledgebase/sound-design/low-end-and-virtual-bass.md); the theatrical tone and rest_dip are starting values chosen for a chase cue; the loudness profiles are references/data/master_targets.json",
  "theatrical": "starting values, off by default (references/mixing/theatrical-realism.md)",
  "immersive": "starting values for the ambisonic bus (references/spatial/immersive-spatial.md)",
  "sympathetic_resonance": "starting values",
  "render": "starting values: worker counts and cache settings",
  "role_chains": "starting values: the EQ and compressor each role starts with (references/mixing/mixing-and-mastering.md section 3)",
  "mastering.fx": "mastering.fx (2026-11-28): an fx chain run on the summed master after the tone, glue and width and before the rest dip, virtual bass and limiter; empty by default, so every older master is unchanged."
 },
